TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Yine merhaba{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yağmurlu kasabamızda yüzmeye devam
ediyorsun demek, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Umarım sen ayrılmadan yağmur diner. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} hakkında sırılsıklam
bir izlenimle gitmeni istemem.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I hope you like our town in the rain.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
We're very proud of our mud,
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Disfruta de nuestro lluvioso pueblo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tenemos el mejor barro que hayas
visto jamás, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I bet this rain will probably stop the
second you leave {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
What a shame, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bahse girerim {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'dan ayrıldığın
saniye bu yağmur duracak!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ne yazık, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
